# Extension TypeScript Conventions

## React

- Functional components and hooks (not class components)
- UI imports from `src/metadata/` and `src/tableau/` via context/hooks only

## Tableau global

- `/* global tableau */` allowed only in `extension/src/tableau/**`
- Never import or reference `tableau` in `src/metadata/` or `src/components/`

## Types

- Workbook tree types in `extension/src/metadata/types.ts`
- Extensions API types from `@tableau/extensions-api-types` in bridge layer only

## Scope

- Minimal diffs; match existing patterns in the extension folder
- One concern per change; do not refactor unrelated code
